{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_6_level_main_06-02_end","groupId":"main_6","stageId":"main_06-02","title":"一些误会","storyCode":"6-2","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_06-02_end.txt","sourceHash":"17423e1809d300de356128a15b38d656075f77c7a2b33cad2b34c688c2d8e634","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"解决整合运动后，煌拎着博士继续前进。\n另一边，陈和诗怀雅谈起了一个线人，似乎是她们共同的熟人。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第二关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_building_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，我也不是打了你就不当你是同胞了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"......算了，这话我自己说了都不信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"煌，通报Blaze-4号小队，俘获十数个整合运动成员。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"有机会的话就来接收，没时间就交给龙门当局了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"那边的龙门人，把弩放下。没必要那么警戒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"我是哪里还得不到你们的信任？我甚至救了你们一命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"退后......！我知道，可、可你......感染者......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，是啊。是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，走了。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"走了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，算了。Dr.{@nickname}，过来。别动，这样快点。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你还好吧。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"哟，看来是习惯让我拎着你跑路了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"别用那种眼神看我，说了，我好着呢，这种事发生过不知道多少次了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"我们去十六区的横山广场吧。整合运动想要突破防线的话，那里是必经之道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......想要趁势一举歼灭整合运动的主要力量，就不能放跑任何一支控制区里的整合运动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"按照阿米娅和那个老气横秋的陈警官的策略，大部分整合运动会被我们这样一点点消磨干净，最后只要打一场歼灭战就行了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"先把横山大厦里的敌人逼出来，让他们逃进包围圈，再去和阿米娅他们会合，一路上顺手打打整合运动。简单明了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"......别这种表情啊，我不是说我好得很吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"哎。你要是再这么盯着我看，我可要直接赖在马路当中不走了啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"抓紧点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"奇怪......你看那边？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"那是梅菲斯特的牧群吗？怎么这也有，他们不应该是由梅菲斯特亲自带领吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"等等。等等？他们......他们为什么在打自己人？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_uptown_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......怎么回事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然一直能收到生理讯息，怎么一条定时通报都收不到？也没有紧急讯号的发送迹象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"究竟出了什么事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"不好好指挥战斗，站在那看什么呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"不关你事，“小姐”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，也太小气了点吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"肯定不能给你看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"我猜你有线人断线了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"能不能别在这种事情上浪费你的直觉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"至少说中了你就会往下说嘛。感染者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"......你怀疑他叛逃？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"绝不可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"那你怀疑的就是这个“绝对不可能”咯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"如果她真的叛逃了......那种后果，我连想都不敢想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，如果她会背叛龙门，整个龙门就没有任何一个人是值得信赖的了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"我好像猜到是谁了欸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"等等......她会愿意去做这个？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"她？干这个？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["陈"]},{"speakerId":"char_015_lmg","aliases":["近卫局成员"]},{"speakerId":"char_017_homura","aliases":["煌"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["整合运动成员"]},{"speakerId":"char_308_swire","aliases":["诗怀雅"]}]}
